      "description": {
        "en": "Black and charcoal HUD skin with dark-gold accents for the DSH web client. It recolors surfaces, borders, focus and selection, replaces the sidebar and blank-session brand marks, plays an arc-reactor boot sequence, and adds a balance readout in the composer status row. Use Settings → General → Jarvis HUD to switch the skin, choose the boot tempo, set the boot policy or replay the sequence; the skin is presentation only and sends nothing to external services. Light mode stays a neutral light-gray variant.",
        "zh": "DSH Web 客户端的黑色 / 炭灰 HUD 主题，暗金强调色。会重绘表面、边框、焦点与选中态，替换侧边栏与空白会话的品牌位，播放电弧反应堆启动动画，并在输入框状态行显示账户余额。在「设置 → 通用 → Jarvis 界面」里可以开关皮肤、调整启动动画节奏、设置播放策略或重播动画；皮肤只影响显示，不会向外部服务发送数据。浅色模式为中性浅灰变体。"
      },
